    "created_at": "2016-09-29T17:59:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-29T17:59:37Z",
    "body": "> That is what this patch does, no?\n\nNot in the same way @wanderview describes. The placeholder idea in particular seems important. And formalizing the fact that such a data structure exists and is shared across all processes would be good.\n",
